@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Admin / Teknisi" as Admin
boundary "Halaman Hotspot" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Hotspot" as DB
participant "MikroTik\nRouter" as MT

== Monitoring Session Aktif ==

Admin -> UI : Buka Dashboard Hotspot
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/hotspot/active-sessions
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> MT : Ambil daftar\nhotspot user aktif
activate MT
MT --> System : Daftar user aktif\n(IP, MAC, Uptime)
deactivate MT

System -> System : Cocokkan session\ndengan data di database
System -> DB : UPDATE status = online,\nlast_seen = NOW()
activate DB
DB --> System : Berhasil
deactivate DB

System -> DB : UPDATE rekap laporan
activate DB
DB --> System : Berhasil
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Data user aktif & statistik
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Admin : Tampilkan user online\n& statistik real-time
deactivate UI

@enduml
